{
  "slug": "unity",
  "name": "Unity",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Unity's official plugin for Claude Code, with curated skills for game development, monetization, and performance optimization.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **29 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (29): `2d-pixel-perfect` (Sets up, diagnoses, and fixes pixel perfect 2D rendering in Unity projects), `audio-setup-mixers` (Scans the scene and audio assets to appropriately route Audio Sources into existing Audio Mixer Groups, classifying each…), `build-live-game` (Build and operate a live game using Unity Services), `implement-in-app-purchases` (Implement, configure, and debug Unity In-App Purchases (IAP) — store connection, product catalog, consumable/non-consumable/subscription purchases, two-step pending-confirm flow,…), `initialize-ai-navigation` (Sets up and configures the Unity AI Navigation system — NavMesh surfaces, NavMesh agents, obstacles, links, modifiers, areas…), `levelplay-unity-integration` (Integrates the LevelPlay Mediation SDK via the Ads Mediation UPM package), `localization` (Sets up and configures Unity Localization, including locales, String/Asset Tables, CJK font support, and Addressables workflows), `manage-sprite-atlas` (Manage SpriteAtlas using prebuild pipeline with IPreprocessBuildWithReport (DEFAULT approach)), and 21 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install unity@claude-plugins-official` from `Unity-Technologies/unity-agent-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
